The two operations requests are not included. This node's capability set is only `LLMClient<inference>`, so the world imports `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0` and nothing else. There is no filesystem interface for the log file and no `http-client` for the metadata service. Adding either would mean reaching for authority the node was not granted, and the item text would also be sent to an outside service. If you need them, they should be added to the node's declared capabilities in the graph, for example as a `Notifier` or `StateHandle` for logging and a scoped `HTTPClient` for enrichment.

